  "rules": [
    [
      "Commit attacks, keep reactions",
      "Draft 10 Basics and 5 Hero cards, at most two copies per design. Your deck needs at least 4 Attacks and 3 Reactions. Attacks and Reactions form separate draw piles. Start with 4 Attacks and 3 Reactions. Commit two Attack cards face down in order."
    ],
    [
      "Flip a pair",
      "Reveal both first attacks. Higher Speed activates first; Edge wins ties. Attack order stays fixed throughout the pair. Printed attack movement happens as that attack activates, before reactions. Choose the landing on the arena."
    ],
    [
      "Trade reactions",
      "The defender reacts first. Alternate one Reaction or Loot card, or pass. Cards resolve immediately. Passing once does not lock you out: playing a card resets the pass count. Two consecutive passes resolve the active attack at the current distance. Then the slower attack activates and gets its own reaction exchange."
    ],
    [
      "No free draws in a fight",
      "Do not draw after reactions or individual attacks. Explicit draw effects may draw Reaction cards; at most one draw effect per player per attack. After all four committed attacks finish, keep unused cards, refill Attacks to 4, and draw at most 2 new Reactions, stopping at 3 held. Fury cards may temporarily increase your Attack hand."
    ],
    [
      "Move, block, boost",
      "Move up to the printed distance: stay, either direction or through your rival, never finish together. Block caps at 6 and clears after each attack, except Helga banks it until the round ends. Attack boosts apply only to the current attack. Push and pull are optional distances. Wall slams add 1 damage; Smasherton adds more."
    ],
    [
      "Payments and health",
      "Mandatory reaction costs are paid when you choose the card. Optional attack payments are chosen at strike resolution after both passes; the printed possible bonus is visible throughout. A Health payment must leave 1 Health. Heal up to 18."
    ],
    [
      "Loot and Coins",
      "Only a resolved Basic Attack earns 1 Coin, even a miss. Reactions never earn Coins, including Basic Reactions. Cap 8 Coins. After the four attacks, buy one blind Loot for 3 Coins or save. Hold two. Loot is played one card at a time on your reaction turn; attacker-only items say so."
    ],
    [
      "Fury",
      "Gain 1 Fury per opposing card that damages you, not per Health point. A card and its wall slam share a source. Full Block and self-payments give none. At 3, your Fury Attack enters your hand once and cycles afterward. You can commit it on your next plan; it is not a reaction. At 5, your permanent upgraded ability activates."
    ],
    [
      "Keep it moving",
      "A knockout ends the fight immediately. Flip second attacks after the first pair finishes. Edge switches after all four attacks. At round 10 cleanup both lose 2 Health, rising by 1 each later round and ignoring Block."
    ]
  ]
}
